        {
          "book": "HOS",
          "chapter": 12,
          "verse": 2
        }
      ],
      "en": "The LORD also has a controversy with Judah, and will punish Jacob according to his ways; according to his deeds he will repay him.",
      "ko": "여호와께서 유다와 쟁변하시고 야곱의 소행대로 벌 주시며 그 소위대로 보응하시리라",
      "source_text_hash": "b9904d70b7d63d81ae0924e5284157001205f8e4f996c76417c8b17cf9ab55fd",
      "translation_text_hash": "4afc67f2a33be6cfef1c462bcc61aeb07afb0ece3fc611f388d7a7cef8764a1b",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "여호와께서 유다와 쟁변하시고 야곱의 소행대로 벌 주시며 그 소위대로 보응하시리라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "4afc67f2a33be6cfef1c462bcc61aeb07afb0ece3fc611f388d7a7cef8764a1b"
      ]
